rname> <given-names>YK</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Lee</surname> <given-names>HW</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>LeDuc</surname> <given-names>JW</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Schmaljohn</surname> <given-names>CS</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Dalrymple</surname> <given-names>JM</given-names></string-name> <article-title>Serological relationships among viruses in the <italic>Hantavirus</italic> genus, family <italic>Bunyaviridae.</italic></article-title><source>Virology</source> <year>1994</year>;<volume>198</volume>:<fpage>196</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>204</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1006/viro.1994.1022</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8259655</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R10"><label>10. </label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Xiao</surname> <given-names>S-Y</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>LeDuc</surname> <given-names>JW</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Chu</surname> <given-names>YK</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Schmaljohn</surname> <given-names>CS</given-names></string-name> <article-title>Phylogenetic analyses of virus isolates in the genus <italic>Hantavirus</italic>, family <italic>Bunyaviridae.</italic></article-title><source>Virology</source> <year>1994</year>;<volume>198</volume>:<fpage>205</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>17</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1006/viro.1994.1023</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8259656</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R11"><label>11. </label><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><string-name><surname>Yanagihara</surname> <given-names>R</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Gajdusek</surname> <given-names>DC</given-names></string-name> Hemorrhagic fever with renal syndrome: a historical perspective and review of recent advances. In: Gear JHS, editor. CRC handbook of viral and rickettsial hemorrhagic fevers. Boca Raton (F